# NOITE's sauna (3fsauna): a right click plays the attendant once and his
# wave (GLOBO2.WAV, 1.415 s), whose end launches the real SAUNA; NOITE
# gets 0x40c at 3965 and hides. No key: the ghosts catch the standing
# Pacman three times and SAUNA reports lost -1900 (the Original at 19425,
# the Corrigida at 20415); NOITE shows itself, adds -1900, takes a life
# (3 -> 2) and goes to the hall (3fhall).
#
# The `--fix all,-sauna_arcade_rules,-sauna_controls_screen` run is the bug fixes on the
# 1995 rules; the Corrigida's arcade game has its own scripts, sauna-corrigida-*.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3fsauna --ms 25000 --input tools/play/sauna-3fsauna-lose.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3fsauna --ms 25000 --fix all,-sauna_arcade_rules,-sauna_controls_screen --input tools/play/sauna-3fsauna-lose.input
1000 rclick 450 330
2000 dump attendant
6000 dump sauna
+0 wait 3fhall 20000
+0 result lost -1900
+0 state
+0 expect 3fhall
